{"id":"e860bc8bff2a4e39","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-partial-function.md","title":"Partial Function","display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-partial-function","aliases":["90-df-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — Partial Function","depends_on":["[[90-df-relation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — Partial Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>二元关系和笛卡尔积使用本地补齐的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4badec96813b3395\" href=\"?note=4badec96813b3395\" title=\"90-df-relation\">90-df-relation</a>；有限数值列与自然数语境由该依赖引入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> (sets)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (binary relation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\)</span> (partial-function predicate, defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\subseteq A\\times B\">\\(f\\subseteq A\\times B\\)</span>；点值记号以下述图约定解释。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h,h&#39;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(h,h&#39;:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Graph}(h)\">\\(\\operatorname{Graph}(h)\\)</span> 把输入元组与输出平铺为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span> 元关系。这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\frown\">\\(\\frown\\)</span> 是集合论有限列连接。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b_1,b_2\\in B\\;\n\\bigl((a,b_1)\\in f\\land(a,b_2)\\in f\\rightarrow b_1=b_2\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b_1,b_2\\in B\\;\n\\bigl((a,b_1)\\in f\\land(a,b_2)\\in f\\rightarrow b_1=b_2\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Graph}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land(\\vec x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nh\\simeq h&#39;&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\\n((\\vec x,y)\\in h\\Longleftrightarrow(\\vec x,y)\\in h&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Graph}(h)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land(\\vec x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nh\\simeq h&#39;&amp;\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\\n((\\vec x,y)\\in h\\Longleftrightarrow(\\vec x,y)\\in h&#39;).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}(f, A, B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}(f, A, B)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>的部分函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)\">\\(f(a)\\)</span>可能未定义（若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>不在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>的定义域内）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}(f) \\subseteq A\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}(f) \\subseteq A\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-relation","status":"resolved","id":"4badec96813b3395","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"二元关系和笛卡尔积使用本地补齐的 [[90-df-relation]]；有限数值列与自然数语境由该依赖引入。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\subseteq A\\times B","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h,h':\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Graph}(h)","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\frown","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\nf\\subseteq A\\times B\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\forall b_1,b_2\\in B\\;\n\\bigl((a,b_1)\\in f\\land(a,b_2)\\in f\\rightarrow b_1=b_2\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{dom}(f)&\\coloneqq\\{a\\in A:\\exists b\\in B\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{ran}(f)&\\coloneqq\\{b\\in B:\\exists a\\in A\\ (a,b)\\in f\\},\\\\\nf:A\\rightharpoonup B&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B),\\\\\nf:A\\to B&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{Partial}(f,A,B)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=A,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow=b&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ (a,b)\\in f,\\\\\nf(a)\\downarrow&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(a)\\uparrow&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ a\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Graph}(h)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle y\\rangle:\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land y\\in\\mathbb N\\land(\\vec x,y)\\in h\\},\\\\\nh\\simeq h'&\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\\n((\\vec x,y)\\in h\\Longleftrightarrow(\\vec x,y)\\in h').\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}(f, A, B)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f(a)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}(f) \\subseteq A","display":false}],"bytes":2088,"backlinks":[{"id":"1802adc1900d4b34","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fac5c810f5035179","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Graph}$ 直接取 [[90-df-partial-function]] 的 $(r+1)$ 元平铺图；$\\mathbb N_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ 是 [[90-df-arithmetic-language]] 的解释元组，而不是另造的五元组。"},{"id":"5f0d45b79409d64f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"725681f54d4cc140","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"523fadf1703582fe","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$、$P\\subseteq\\mathbb N^{k+1}$ 为任意关系，不预设可判定或可枚举；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"65cecff06a8bc84e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 是全函数；自然数及次序见 [[90-df-omega]]，部分函数见 [[90-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"5d66bf24ea0c6e5a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Partial}$、函数图、定义域、部分点值及 $\\simeq$ 的外延形式取 [[90-df-partial-function]]；递归函数类见 [[90-df-recursive-function-class]]。"},{"id":"